    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "QANTAS\n. • . . . . . . . . . . .",
      "POST CARD\n*QANTAS\nFLIGHT NO.\nThe Qantas 767 Extended Range aircraft is about haif the\nsize of its big Boeing brother, the 747. It is 48.51 m long, has\na wingspan of 47.57 m, a maximum take-off weight of\n159,210 kg and a range of about 7500km with a full payload.\nThe aircraft incorporates the most advanced materials and\ntechnology, with the two pilots using a computerised flight\nmanagement system.\n2e21.0810142"
    ],
